    "blurb": "Automate Google Meet across your processes",
    "overview": "Automate Google Meet meeting creation, scheduling, updates, and cancellations directly from Camunda processes. Connect to Google Calendar and Google Meet APIs using secure OAuth 2.0 authentication.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate meeting scheduling from any business process",
    "splashDescription": "Coordinating meetings across teams and stakeholders is a routine part of business processes like onboarding, approvals, and incident management. Manual scheduling creates delays and coordination overhead that slow down process execution. The Google Meet Connector lets teams automate meeting creation, scheduling, updates, and cancellations directly from Camunda processes. It connects to Google Calendar and Google Meet via OAuth 2.0, generates Meet links automatically, sends calendar invitations to attendees, and makes meeting details available for downstream process decisions. Teams can embed meeting coordination into any process without leaving Camunda.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/829717/overview/img5709564536335026704.png?2864d27ba0fa1ea5704db60e033d2c8d",
